{"4514800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Airport City Transport Manager", "steam_appid": 4514800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/9973f7395b9c3849e190b83923d905ca.poster.avif?t=1788165314\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/9973f7395b9c3849e190b83923d905ca.webm?t=1788165314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/9973f7395b9c3849e190b83923d905ca.mp4?t=1788165314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛩️ <strong>WELCOME TO YOUR ULTIMATE AIRPORT EMPIRE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airport games are a wonderful adventure, but this is more than your average city simulator or tycoon game. It combines the exciting sense of adventure from flight games with the strategic planning of top city builders! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of repetitive farm sims and basic plane games? Put your farm on hold. Start building a tiny town and transform it into a massive megapolis with a world-class modern airport! We constantly update the game to ensure you are always engaged—both on the ground and in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to be a powerful air tycoon or a skilled airline commander, you’ll find something to love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/1c06c7e9c9eb84fe39ca9ccb83a28b77.poster.avif?t=1788165314\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/1c06c7e9c9eb84fe39ca9ccb83a28b77.webm?t=1788165314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/1c06c7e9c9eb84fe39ca9ccb83a28b77.mp4?t=1788165314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 <strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Build Your Hub:</strong> Construct a modern international terminal to send flights anywhere in the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Planes &amp; Helicopters:</strong> Fly your aircraft to any destination, from a faraway town to a shining megapolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Collect Rare Items:</strong> Bring back rare artifacts, unique collections, and souvenirs from your travels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Manage Infrastructure:</strong> Develop the city next to your hub to provide your airport with all required services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Form Alliances:</strong> Team up with other players to complete joint quests, join competitions, and double your fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/151989c8ccb3b8985828b17b643f2ef8.poster.avif?t=1788165314\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/151989c8ccb3b8985828b17b643f2ef8.webm?t=1788165314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/151989c8ccb3b8985828b17b643f2ef8.mp4?t=1788165314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👑 <strong>BECOME THE ULTIMATE TYCOON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Test Your Skills:</strong> Develop your airport and build a massive aircraft collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Build a Megapolis:</strong> Upgrade your town, collect profits, and support your growing airport infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Global Transport Hub:</strong> Manage unique buildings and travel destinations in a breathtaking tycoon simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Connect with Friends:</strong> Join alliances, interact with like-minded players, and dominate special events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Explore the World:</strong> Travel to your favorite global destinations and bring home exclusive collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is intended exclusively for users aged 18 and over due to the inclusion of in-app purchases.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/9973f7395b9c3849e190b83923d905ca.poster.avif?t=1788165314\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/9973f7395b9c3849e190b83923d905ca.webm?t=1788165314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/9973f7395b9c3849e190b83923d905ca.mp4?t=1788165314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛩️ <strong>WELCOME TO YOUR ULTIMATE AIRPORT EMPIRE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airport games are a wonderful adventure, but this is more than your average city simulator or tycoon game. It combines the exciting sense of adventure from flight games with the strategic planning of top city builders! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of repetitive farm sims and basic plane games? Put your farm on hold. Start building a tiny town and transform it into a massive megapolis with a world-class modern airport! We constantly update the game to ensure you are always engaged—both on the ground and in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to be a powerful air tycoon or a skilled airline commander, you’ll find something to love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/1c06c7e9c9eb84fe39ca9ccb83a28b77.poster.avif?t=1788165314\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/1c06c7e9c9eb84fe39ca9ccb83a28b77.webm?t=1788165314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/extras/1c06c7e9c9eb84fe39ca9ccb83a28b77.mp4?t=1788165314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 <strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Build Your Hub:</strong> Construct a modern international terminal to send flights anywhere in the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Planes &amp; Helicopters:</strong> Fly your aircraft to any destination, from a faraway town to a shining megapolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Collect Rare Items:</strong> Bring back rare artifacts, unique collections, and souvenirs from your travels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Manage Infrastructure:</strong> Develop the city next to your hub to provide your airport with all required services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Form Alliances:</strong> Team up with other players to complete joint quests, join competitions, and double your fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514800/ext